    {
      "description": "Get computed index scores for regions. Returns rankings + render_map_input payload.\n\nMODES:\n  - mode=\"rank\" (default): Top N regions ranked by index score\n  - mode=\"compare\": Compare specific regions head-to-head (pass regions=[\"A\",\"B\",\"C\"])\n  - mode=\"filter\": Show all districts within a state (pass state_filter=\"Maharashtra\")\n\nAVAILABLE INDICES: ev_adoption, vehicle_density, ev_per_capita, income_proxy, fuel_transition, pop_growth, credit_activity\n\nTIME FILTER: Pass \"year\" and/or \"month\" to get data for a specific period. When omitted, returns the all-time aggregate.\n\nRENDER FLAG: Set \"render\":true to get the SVG map inline without a separate render_map call.\n\nNEXT STEP: When render=false (default), call render_map with the returned render_map_input to generate the SVG map visualization.",
